{
  "version": 1,
  "comment": "钩子的单一定义来源（动作名与权限清单不在这里，见 docs/plugin-js-api.md 与 docs/plugin-native-api.md）。tools/gen_contract.dart 由此生成 Dart 常量、C++ 头与插件作者文档；改动后必须重新生成并提交生成物。doc 字段会写进 Dart 枚举注释与作者文档：P0（应用侧已埋点）的钩子在这里写清载荷字段与裁决语义，其余保持空。",
  "hooks": [
    { "id": "musicxx.app.start", "dart": "appStart", "mode": "observe", "policy": "lastWrite", "dispatch": "async", "budgetMs": 0, "hardMs": 0, "phase": "P0", "doc": "载荷 `{version, platform, branch, installId, lang}`。应用启动阶段（业务 Store 与插件宿主都就绪之后）派发一次：适合做初始化自己的状态、登记定时器这类事，观察型没有裁决。" },
    { "id": "musicxx.app.ready", "dart": "appReady", "mode": "observe", "policy": "lastWrite", "dispatch": "async", "budgetMs": 0, "hardMs": 0, "phase": "P0", "doc": "载荷 `{firstRun, restoredSong}`：`firstRun` = 是否首次启动，`restoredSong` = 恢复播放的歌曲（可能缺省）。首屏与数据都就绪后派发一次（比 `app.start` 晚），观察型。" },
    { "id": "musicxx.app.background", "dart": "appBackground", "mode": "observe", "policy": "lastWrite", "dispatch": "async", "budgetMs": 0, "hardMs": 0, "phase": "P1", "doc": "" },
    { "id": "musicxx.app.foreground", "dart": "appForeground", "mode": "observe", "policy": "lastWrite", "dispatch": "async", "budgetMs": 0, "hardMs": 0, "phase": "P1", "doc": "" },
    { "id": "musicxx.app.exit", "dart": "appExit", "mode": "decision", "policy": "anyCancel", "dispatch": "sync", "budgetMs": 30, "hardMs": 100, "phase": "P1", "doc": "" },
    { "id": "musicxx.app.deepLink", "dart": "appDeepLink", "mode": "decision", "policy": "anyCancel", "dispatch": "sync", "budgetMs": 30, "hardMs": 100, "phase": "P1", "doc": "" },
    { "id": "musicxx.app.upgrade", "dart": "appUpgrade", "mode": "observe", "policy": "lastWrite", "dispatch": "async", "budgetMs": 0, "hardMs": 0, "phase": "P1", "doc": "" },
    { "id": "musicxx.player.beforePlaySong", "dart": "playerBeforePlaySong", "mode": "decision", "policy": "anyCancel", "dispatch": "async", "budgetMs": 30, "hardMs": 100, "phase": "P0", "doc": "载荷 `{sid, song, mode, quality}`：`song` 是只读视图（`sid/name/artist/album/durationMs/year/genre/srcKey/audio[]/video[]`，不含音频直链），`mode` = 播放模式、`quality` = 当前音质。裁决只实现 `{\"action\":\"skip\"}` = 跳过本曲（走应用既有的切下一曲流程）；`patch`（换音源/改音质）当前版本未实现，会被记一条日志后忽略。异步派发：切歌不会被插件拖慢；等待期间若又来了新的切歌请求，本次裁决被丢弃（插件可以自己用 `sid` 判断）。" },
    { "id": "musicxx.player.source.beforeParse", "dart": "playerSourceBeforeParse", "mode": "decision", "policy": "firstNonNull", "dispatch": "async", "budgetMs": 50, "hardMs": 200, "phase": "P0", "doc": "载荷 `{sid, srcKey, src, index, tryLocalOrCache}`：`src` 是音源视图（`type/empty/srcKey/quality/durationMs/hashMd5/size`），`index` = 本轮解析的音源下标。裁决：`{\"action\":\"skip\"}` = 本轮不解析该音源（调用方接着试下一个）；`patch.src = {\"type\":\"Local|UrlLink|Bili|...\",\"src\":\"<新地址>\",\"info\":{...}}` = 只替换本轮使用的音源（不改动歌曲实体的音源列表），字段不合法会被忽略。异步派发（不卡住解析），等待期间切歌则本次裁决作废。" },
    { "id": "musicxx.player.source.resolved", "dart": "playerSourceResolved", "mode": "observe", "policy": "lastWrite", "dispatch": "async", "budgetMs": 0, "hardMs": 0, "phase": "P0", "doc": "载荷 `{sid, srcKey, useSrcKey, parsedType, pathKind, hasHeaders, cacheStream}`：某个音源解析完成（拿到真正播放用的路径与请求头）之后派发。载荷里没有直链与 token，只报来源类型与路径种类（本地 / 缓存 / 远程流 / 带请求头）；观察型。" },
    { "id": "musicxx.player.beforeOpen", "dart": "playerBeforeOpen", "mode": "decision", "policy": "firstNonNull", "dispatch": "async", "budgetMs": 50, "hardMs": 200, "phase": "P1", "doc": "" },
    { "id": "musicxx.player.state", "dart": "playerState", "mode": "observe", "policy": "lastWrite", "dispatch": "async", "budgetMs": 0, "hardMs": 0, "phase": "P0", "doc": "载荷 `{state, sid, positionMs}`。`state` 是播放状态文本：播放 / 暂停 / 停止这三个事件给 `play`、`pause`、`stop`，其它状态变化给枚举名 `Play` / `Pause` / `Stop` / `Completed`；要判断当前是否在播放，请读状态镜像 `musicxx.state.env.isPlaying`（布尔）。观察型，只在播放状态变化时派发（播放进度不走这个钩子）。" },
    { "id": "musicxx.player.position", "dart": "playerPosition", "mode": "observe", "policy": "lastWrite", "dispatch": "async", "budgetMs": 0, "hardMs": 0, "phase": "P1", "doc": "" },
    { "id": "musicxx.player.seek", "dart": "playerSeek", "mode": "decision", "policy": "anyCancel", "dispatch": "sync", "budgetMs": 30, "hardMs": 100, "phase": "P1", "doc": "" },
    { "id": "musicxx.player.volume", "dart": "playerVolume", "mode": "decision", "policy": "anyCancel", "dispatch": "sync", "budgetMs": 30, "hardMs": 100, "phase": "P1", "doc": "" },
    { "id": "musicxx.player.speed", "dart": "playerSpeed", "mode": "decision", "policy": "anyCancel", "dispatch": "sync", "budgetMs": 30, "hardMs": 100, "phase": "P1", "doc": "" },
    { "id": "musicxx.player.pitch", "dart": "playerPitch", "mode": "decision", "policy": "anyCancel", "dispatch": "sync", "budgetMs": 30, "hardMs": 100, "phase": "P1", "doc": "" },
    { "id": "musicxx.player.error", "dart": "playerError", "mode": "decision", "policy": "anyCancel", "dispatch": "sync", "budgetMs": 30, "hardMs": 100, "phase": "P0", "doc": "载荷 `{sid, srcKey, isNowUseSrc, errorCount, durationMs, positionMs}`（`errorCount` 已包含本次失败）。裁决：`{\"action\":\"stop\"}` = 停止播放；`{\"action\":\"skip\"}`（或 `cancel`）= 跳到下一曲；`{\"action\":\"continue\",\"patch\":{\"tryNextSrc\":false}}` = 不再尝试当前源（跳过忽略错误并重试的分支，直接按应用的换源/下一曲策略走）。这是**同步派发**的钩子，调用点只等 120 ms，超时按无裁决继续。" },
    { "id": "musicxx.player.completed", "dart": "playerCompleted", "mode": "observe", "policy": "lastWrite", "dispatch": "async", "budgetMs": 0, "hardMs": 0, "phase": "P0", "doc": "载荷 `{sid, playedMs}`：一曲播放完成（正常结束或按完成处理）之后派发；观察型。它只表示这首歌放完了，不代表已经切歌（切歌另有 `musicxx.song.changed`）。" },
    { "id": "musicxx.player.qualityChanged", "dart": "playerQualityChanged", "mode": "observe", "policy": "lastWrite", "dispatch": "async", "budgetMs": 0, "hardMs": 0, "phase": "P1", "doc": "" },
    { "id": "musicxx.media.notification", "dart": "mediaNotification", "mode": "decision", "policy": "lastWrite", "dispatch": "sync", "budgetMs": 30, "hardMs": 100, "phase": "P1", "doc": "" },
    { "id": "musicxx.song.changed", "dart": "songChanged", "mode": "observe", "policy": "lastWrite", "dispatch": "async", "budgetMs": 0, "hardMs": 0, "phase": "P0", "doc": "载荷 `{sid, prevSid, song}`：`song` 与 `beforePlaySong` 的同一个只读视图，`prevSid` = 上一首的 sid（没有则为 null）。切歌时派发；派发前宿主会先刷新状态镜像，所以处理器里同步读 `musicxx.state.song` 拿到的就是新歌。观察型。" },
    { "id": "musicxx.song.info.analyse", "dart": "songInfoAnalyse", "mode": "decision", "policy": "firstNonNull", "dispatch": "sync", "budgetMs": 30, "hardMs": 100, "phase": "P1", "doc": "" },
    { "id": "musicxx.song.meta.writeback", "dart": "songMetaWriteback", "mode": "observe", "policy": "lastWrite", "dispatch": "async", "budgetMs": 0, "hardMs": 0, "phase": "P1", "doc": "" },
    { "id": "musicxx.song.beforeAdd", "dart": "songBeforeAdd", "mode": "decision", "policy": "anyCancel", "dispatch": "sync", "budgetMs": 30, "hardMs": 100, "phase": "P1", "doc": "" },
    { "id": "musicxx.song.removed", "dart": "songRemoved", "mode": "observe", "policy": "lastWrite", "dispatch": "async", "budgetMs": 0, "hardMs": 0, "phase": "P1", "doc": "" },
    { "id": "musicxx.playlist.loaded", "dart": "playlistLoaded", "mode": "observe", "policy": "lastWrite", "dispatch": "async", "budgetMs": 0, "hardMs": 0, "phase": "P1", "doc": "" },
    { "id": "musicxx.playlist.filter", "dart": "playlistFilter", "mode": "decision", "policy": "allMerge", "dispatch": "async", "budgetMs": 50, "hardMs": 200, "phase": "P1", "doc": "" },
    { "id": "musicxx.songlist.filter", "dart": "songlistFilter", "mode": "decision", "policy": "allMerge", "dispatch": "async", "budgetMs": 50, "hardMs": 200, "phase": "P1", "doc": "" },
